# Blog Mermaid

**Before editing Mermaid init, `MermaidDiagram`, or `.blog-mermaid-chart` CSS, read:**

`guidelines/agent-devlog-mermaid.md`  
**Index:** `guidelines/agent-devlog-index.md`

## Quick rules (full history in that file)

- **Use:** `theme: 'default'`, `startOnLoad: false`, `mermaid.render()` per chart, wrapper class `blog-mermaid-chart`
- **Do not:** `theme: 'base'` + `themeVariables`, `contentLoaded()`, post-render SVG JS, `#mermaid-*` CSS selectors
- **Colors:** change hex in `globals.css` under `.blog-mermaid-chart` only
- **Test:** http://localhost:5300/endtoend-engineer/blogs/1 after any change
